{"seq":26,"slug":"mobile-offline-sync","title":"移动端离线与同步","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync","rating":{"composite":4.41,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 移动端离线与同步\n\n移动应用运行在网络状态高度不确定的环境中——地铁、电梯、偏远地区、跨国漫游，都会让「服务端是唯一真相源」的传统假设失效。离线优先架构将数据主权交还给设备端，让应用在无网络时依然完整可用，网络恢复后自动完成双向同步。这不再是某个功能开关，而是 2026 年移动端产品的默认架构选择。\n\n本 hub 系统性地覆盖移动端离线数据管理与同步的完整知识链：从离线优先的设计哲学、本地存储选型、网络状态感知，到同步协议设计、冲突解决策略、CRDT 在移动场景的工程落地，再到 iOS/Android/跨平台的具体实现方案，最后是生产环境中的监控调试与资源优化。\n\n**与兄弟 hub 的分工边界：**\n\n- [ios-development](../01_ios-development/_INTRODUCTION.md) 和 [android-development](../05_android-development/_INTRODUCTION.md) 覆盖平台基础能力，本 hub 聚焦离线同步这一垂直切面的深度方案\n- [mobile-performance](../08_mobile-performance/_INTRODUCTION.md) 关注整体性能优化，本 hub 的「带宽与电量优化」专注于同步场景下的资源消耗\n- [ios-networking-data-layer](../13_ios-networking-data-layer/_INTRODUCTION.md) 覆盖网络层通用设计，本 hub 关注的是离线到在线切换期间的数据一致性保障\n- [cross-platform-development](../07_cross-platform-development/_INTRODUCTION.md) 讨论跨平台框架选型，本 hub 的跨平台章节聚焦于同步引擎的跨平台落地\n\n**推荐学习路径：**\n\n1. 先读「基础篇」建立离线优先的思维模型和技术基座\n2. 再进入「同步引擎篇」理解协议设计与冲突解决的理论框架\n3. 然后选择与自身技术栈匹配的「实现篇」章节深入实践\n4. 最后通过「运维篇」掌握生产环境的可观测性与优化手段\n\n**前置知识：** 熟悉至少一个移动平台的开发基础（iOS 或 Android）、了解基本的数据库操作（SQL/NoSQL）、对分布式系统的 CAP 定理有初步认知。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"offline-first-principles","title":"离线优先设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/offline-first-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"local-storage-strategies","title":"本地存储策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/local-storage-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-state-detection","title":"网络状态检测与切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/network-state-detection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-engines","title":"同步引擎篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-protocol-design","title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/sync-protocol-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conflict-resolution-strategies","title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crdt-mobile-applications","title":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/crdt-mobile-applications"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"实现篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ios-core-data-cloudkit","title":"iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/ios-core-data-cloudkit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"android-room-workmanager","title":"Android Room 与 WorkManager","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/android-room-workmanager"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-platform-sync-solutions","title":"跨平台同步方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/cross-platform-sync-solutions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-monitoring-debugging","title":"同步监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/sync-monitoring-debugging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bandwidth-battery-optimization","title":"带宽与电量优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-migration-versioning","title":"数据迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/data-migration-versioning"}]}]}